/* ── SECTION 01 — the four streams. NAMES ONLY; see the header note. ─────── */

/* ── SECTION 02 — four feature points under the Monash copy ───────────────── */

/* ── SECTION 03 — the 2×2 information cards ───────────────────────────────── */

/* ── SECTION 04 — every line is a published facility ──────────────────────── */

